      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003E314. Sweet Omelettes\u003C/b\u003E. - Beat four eggs into a basin, add a tablespoonful of milk, a teaspoonful of sugar, a pinch of salt, and beat them well up; put some nice butter into pan, put in the eggs, and fry as before described. Serve with sugar sifted over.\u003Cbr\u003E"
